@@ -40,9 +40,16 @@
 ## New Features
 
 * [GH-904](https://github.com/apache/mina-sshd/issues/904) Log local port in `ClientSessionImpl.toString()` to be able to distinguish multiple sessions to the same host in logs
+* `HostConfigEntry` handles `Match` blocks and `Include` files in ssh config files the way OpenSSH does
 
 ## Potential Compatibility Issues
 
+* In an ssh config file, the first value given for a keyword now also wins within one `Host` block, as in OpenSSH;
+previously the last one did. A keyword now ends at the first blank or `=`, as in OpenSSH, so an `=` in a value no
+longer splits the line, quoted arguments are read without their quotes, a `#` starts a comment only where an
+argument would start, and `IdentityFile` and `CertificateFile` paths are no longer split at commas.
+* `HostConfigEntry.writeHostConfigEntries` writes an entry read from an ssh config file as its lines in file order,
+`Include` lines included and arguments quoted where needed, instead of host name, port, user and identities first.
 
 ## Major Code Re-factoring
 
